# Optional environment for Horizon. Copy to the Horizon checkout as .env.
# The installer creates this for you; it is listed here for reference only.

# Without a token GitHub allows 60 API requests/hour. A normal run uses ~16,
# so one extra manual run can exhaust the budget. With a token: 5000/hour.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Only needed if you set PODCAST_TTS_MODEL to something other than "edge",
# or PODCAST_SCRIPT_ENGINE=podcastfy. The defaults need no keys at all.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
